      "label": "Prompt Analyzer",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "/home/user/crustly/docs/guides/PROMPT_ANALYZER.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Automatically detects keywords in user prompts and appends explicit tool hints before sending to the LLM, to ensure correct tool usage and reduce ambiguity. Transparent (user sees the original prompt, LLM gets the enhanced one) and non-intrusive (only activates on keyword detection). Implemented in src/tui/prompt_analyzer.rs, integrated via src/tui/app.rs send_message."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_guides_prompt_analyzer_keyword_detection",
      "label": "Regex Keyword Detection",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "/home/user/crustly/docs/guides/PROMPT_ANALYZER.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Regex-based keyword matching with word boundaries and case-insensitive detection maps prompt phrases to tool hints (plan, read_file, grep, write_file, edit_file, bash, web_search); supports multiple tool detection per prompt."
    },
